# Outputs directory
#
# Place VASP output files here after a completed calculation, e.g.:
#   OUTCAR       — main output (energies, forces, timings)
#   CONTCAR      — final geometry (relaxed positions)
#   DOSCAR       — density of states data
#   EIGENVAL     — band energies
#   vasprun.xml  — full structured output (parseable by ASE / pymatgen)
#   CHGCAR       — charge density
#
# This directory is tracked in git (via .gitkeep) but its contents are
# excluded from version control by the top-level .gitignore.
